{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45562","headline":"杞梁妻 · 贯休","name":"杞梁妻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦之无道兮四海枯，筑长城兮遮北胡。\n筑人筑土一万里，杞梁贞妇啼呜呜。\n上无父兮中无夫，下无子兮孤复孤。\n一号城崩塞色苦，再号杞梁骨出土。\n疲魂饥魄相逐归，陌上少年莫相非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}